    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The Applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with C.R.No.235/2023 registered at\nKandivali Police Station, Mumbai on 14.4.2023 under sections 465, 420, 170 read with 34 of Ipc.",
