    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Pramila Santosh Shahpur vs State Of Maharashtra on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/56873950/\n1  :2: 10.aba-713-24.odt 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 903,
      "end": 1051,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pramila Santosh Shahpur vs State Of Maharashtra on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 904,
          "end": 983
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The FIR is lodged by one Arun Gadakh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1052,
      "end": 1089,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Arun Gadakh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1077,
          "end": 1088
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04961646720767021
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "He was concerned with M/s. Shri Sidhivinayak (Kandivali) S.R.A. Co- operative Housing Society Limited, Kandivali (West).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1090,
      "end": 1210,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sidhivinayak",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1122,
          "end": 1134
        },
        {
          "text": "S.R.A. Co- operative Housing Society Limited, Kandivali",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1147,
          "end": 1202
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08878792077302933
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The informant has stated that said building was seven storey building and from 1st floor to 7th floor there were 12 rooms.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1211,
      "end": 1333,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.054008305072784424
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "15 rooms were reserved for Municipal Corporation of Greater Mumbai [MCGM], out of which three rooms were allotted by MCGM and 12 rooms were reserved for them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1334,
      "end": 1492,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Municipal Corporation of Greater Mumbai",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1361,
          "end": 1400
        },
        {
          "text": "MCGM",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1402,
          "end": 1406
        },
        {
          "text": "MCGM",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1451,
          "end": 1455
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13528642058372498
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The informant was the Secretary of the said society since August, 2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1493,
      "end": 1564,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15295490622520447
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "On 12.12.2022 at about 1.00 p.m. about 7 to 8 persons came to the society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1565,
      "end": 1639,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "12.12.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1568,
          "end": 1578
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19514432549476624
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Out of them, one of them gave her name as Pramila Shahpur.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1640,
      "end": 1698,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pramila Shahpur",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1682,
          "end": 1697
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15431496500968933
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "According to the prosecution case, she is the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1699,
      "end": 1764,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14131958782672882
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "She claimed that she was an employee of MCGM.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1765,
      "end": 1810,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "MCGM",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1805,
          "end": 1809
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15555953979492188
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "She had brought a letter on the letter-head of the MCGM mentioning that the room Nos.707, 708, 709, 710, 711 and 712 were allotted to the persons accompanying her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1811,
      "end": 1974,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1290058046579361
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The informant told them that as per Rules each of the members had to pay Rs.1,30,000/- to the society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1975,
      "end": 2077,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14119386672973633
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Those persons accordingly gave cheques in the name of the society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2078,
      "end": 2145,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17252863943576813
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The 2 of 6 :3: 10.aba-713-24.odt informant told the Applicant that since MCGM had not informed the society about it, no steps would be taken in that behalf.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2146,
      "end": 2302,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "MCGM",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2219,
          "end": 2223
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11017056554555893
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The Applicant and others then went away.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2303,
      "end": 2343,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18994542956352234
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Before leaving the place, the Applicant had given a photo-copy of her identity card to the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2344,
      "end": 2445,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14232955873012543
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "On that document it was mentioned that the Applicant was working as a Clerk with the Assistant Engineer (R-South).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2446,
      "end": 2560,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1949457973241806
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The informant retained the documents and a copy of that identity card.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2561,
      "end": 2631,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16037586331367493
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "On 24.11.2022, the society received a letter that the keys of locks of the aforesaid room numbers as well as room Nos.004, 007,\n008, 0012, 704, 705, 706 were missing and their employee would come to the society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2632,
      "end": 2843,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.11.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2635,
          "end": 2645
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22624646127223969
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "On 28.11.2022, the Applicant came to the society with one more person and she changed the locks of all these rooms and went away.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2844,
      "end": 2973,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "28.11.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2847,
          "end": 2857
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15356162190437317
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "On 31.1.2023, the society received a letter mentioning that those particular rooms were allotted to different persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2974,
      "end": 3092,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.1.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2977,
          "end": 2986
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13141699135303497
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "The informant got suspicious.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3093,
      "end": 3122,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16463258862495422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "He went to the office of Assistant Commissioner, R-South Ward.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3123,
      "end": 3185,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08574753254652023
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "He showed the letter and copy of the identity card of the Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3186,
      "end": 3254,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09618042409420013
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The Assistant Commissioner told him that those 3 of 6 :4: 10.aba-713-24.odt were the forged documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3255,
      "end": 3357,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08447828143835068
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "The informant realized that the Applicant had committed that offence and thereafter this FIR is lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3358,
      "end": 3461,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11940418183803558
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the Applicant submitted that the Applicant is innocent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3463,
      "end": 3541,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12495727837085724
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "She was always available but the police did not arrest her and there is suddenly no reason for the police to arrest her now.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3542,
      "end": 3666,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11323624104261398
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "She is willing to cooperate with the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3667,
      "end": 3718,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12285240739583969
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Her cooperation by attending the police station would be sufficient.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3719,
      "end": 3787,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10554995387792587
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Her custodial interrogation is not necessary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3788,
      "end": 3833,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10630013793706894
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "5. Learned APP opposed these submissions and produced the investigation papers before the Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3834,
      "end": 3931,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07229571789503098
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "6. I have considered these submissions and I have perused the investigation papers.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3932,
      "end": 4016,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "The investigation carried out shows that the victims in this offence have paid money at the instance of the Applicant to one Pramod Patkar.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4017,
      "end": 4156,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pramod Patkar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4142,
          "end": 4155
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12011859565973282
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "All these accused were working in collusion.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4157,
      "end": 4201,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13448427617549896
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "The statement of Pramila Santosh Shahpur vs State Of Maharashtra on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/56873950/\n2 one",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 4202,
      "end": 4344,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pramila Santosh Shahpur vs State Of Maharashtra on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 4219,
          "end": 4298
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "Suryakant Aherkar shows that he wanted to purchase a room.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4345,
      "end": 4403,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Suryakant Aherkar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4345,
          "end": 4362
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06260360032320023
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "4 of 6",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4404,
      "end": 4412,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04966580122709274
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": ":5: 10.aba-713-24.odt",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4413,
      "end": 4435,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0367986261844635
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
