      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13593542575836182
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 58,
      "text": "The Applicant introduced the office bearers of the society that she was officer of MCGM and that those rooms were allotted by MCGM to Suryakant and others.",
